{"1833860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Olympian Knights", "steam_appid": 1833860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<strong>A Greek mythology-based 3D multiplayer dueling/fighting game where each character wields a unique weapon and possesses their own set of abilities.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833860/extras/28db44ef39af9ff61434c91403b33e64.poster.avif?t=1778001846\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833860/extras/28db44ef39af9ff61434c91403b33e64.webm?t=1778001846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833860/extras/28db44ef39af9ff61434c91403b33e64.mp4?t=1778001846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Easy to learn and straight forward combat system, with some mechanics for more advanced players.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833860/extras/aec96fdbaeed9b0eb1bd7795e784db8f.poster.avif?t=1778001846\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833860/extras/aec96fdbaeed9b0eb1bd7795e784db8f.webm?t=1778001846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833860/extras/aec96fdbaeed9b0eb1bd7795e784db8f.mp4?t=1778001846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Game modes:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>1 vs 1 Duels<br></li><li>2 vs 2 Duels<br></li><li>God game (Kill oppnenents to get the next character, win by reaching the last character first)<br></li><li>Team Deathmatch<br></li><li>Deathmatch Free for All</li></ul><br><strong